From bcd7299f7a6640f100beef96019433a3f68a421b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bad3r <github@unsigned.sh>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 00:25:06 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Match icon sizes as the icon theme specification does

find_icon_in_theme() accepted a Threshold directory for any size between
Size / Threshold and Size * Threshold, ignored Scale, and returned nothing
when no directory matched. With the default threshold of 2, a 16x16
directory answered a 32 px request ahead of 32x32 or scalable icons, and a
size without a matching directory (including min_icon_size = 0) found no
icon at all.

Follow the specification's LookupIcon: a directory matches at scale 1
when Fixed Size equals the size, Scalable MinSize <= size <= MaxSize, or
Threshold Size - Threshold <= size <= Size + Threshold. Without a match,
return the icon from the directory with the smallest DirectorySizeDistance,
preferring the larger directory on a tie, before trying inherited themes.
